 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal in April to May and 478% in August to September. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 30% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid listed had its driest year in 2013, and grid 18939 got 20% of normal that year.</p>"}
